        <briefdescription>
<para>Renders all entities with <ref refid="structTransform" kindref="compound">Transform</ref> and SpriteRenderer components. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This method iterates over all entities that have both <ref refid="structTransform" kindref="compound">Transform</ref> and SpriteRenderer components. For each entity, it checks if the texture is valid, builds the model matrix, and calls DrawTexturedQuad on the <ref refid="classRenderer" kindref="compound">Renderer</ref>.</para>
