    <briefdescription>
<para>System that renders all entities with <ref refid="structTransform" kindref="compound">Transform</ref> and SpriteRenderer components. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classRenderSystem" kindref="compound">RenderSystem</ref> is responsible for drawing all visible entities in the scene. It processes entities that have both a <ref refid="structTransform" kindref="compound">Transform</ref> (position, rotation, scale) and a SpriteRenderer (texture) component, calculates the model matrix, and calls the <ref refid="classRenderer" kindref="compound">Renderer</ref> to draw each entity.</para>
<para>Entities with a TileScale component use its value; entities without TileScale default to 1.0f (no repetition, texture stretches to fill the quad).</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This system should be called once per frame from the scene&apos;s <ref refid="classRenderSystem_1a0dee88c7afdb4acfa6ad44e3902ce7a3" kindref="member">Render()</ref> method. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="structComponents_1_1Transform" kindref="compound">Components::Transform</ref>, <ref refid="structComponents_1_1SpriteRenderer" kindref="compound">Components::SpriteRenderer</ref>, <ref refid="structComponents_1_1TileScale" kindref="compound">Components::TileScale</ref>, <ref refid="classRenderer" kindref="compound">Renderer</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
